    "created_at": "2017-08-14T15:03:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-08-14T15:03:36Z",
    "body": "To me the basic problem here is that we're using the abort algorithms as pseudo-event-handlers. What you would ideally like is for them to be interleaved, I think.\r\n\r\nUnless we're interested in creating an \"abstract event listeners\" concept, I'm not sure this is worth solving.",
