    "created_at": "2017-12-20T12:28:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-12-20T12:28:10Z",
    "body": "For clarity: I'm fine with either outcome. It doesn't seem to matter for the use cases I have in mind. It does seem like it would be best to agree upon behavior, but as long as there's agreement, I'm happy.",
